  "dcterms:description": "A streaming RDF (n-triples) transformation of PubChem BioAssay core result rows, preserving canonical PubChem AID, SID and CID links, deposited activity outcome, PubChem normalized activity score and reported SMILES. It is built from the intermediate BioBricks brick 'nih-pubchem-bioassays' (see .bb/dependencies.txt), which itself is sourced from the NCBI PubChem BioAssay archive. PubChem is a US National Library of Medicine / NCBI resource; government-created content is public domain, though depositor content may retain rights.",
